 guides=G("<b>Tap any square</b>, the snake or the ladder. The text below the board tells you what that rule leads to.","Press <b>▶ Play Anna</b>, watch where she ends up, then <b>↺ Reset</b> and press <b>▶ Play Sam</b>.","Compare the two rounds: same demands, different resources. Say which pieces made the difference."),
